    "text": "By Emily Storm ,\n12 hours ago JACKSON COUNTY, Ore.- A local non-profit is helping kids in the Phoenix- Talent and Ashland School Districts bundle up for the winter. This year, the Ashland Community Health Foundation collected 1,830 mittens, gloves and hats for its annual drive to be distributed at more than three schools. The program started... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
